(PART D — LT POWER AND CONTROL CABLES) Tj T*
(4.1 LT power cables shall be XLPE insulated 1.1 kV grade armoured cables with aluminium) Tj T*
(conductors as per IS 7098 \(Part 1\):1988.) Tj T*
(4.2 Size of the incoming feeder cable shall be 3.5 core x 300 Sq.mm.) Tj T*
(4.3 Continuous conductor operating temperature of XLPE cables shall be 90°C. Copper) Tj T*
(control cables of 2.5 Sq.mm shall be PVC insulated heavy duty type as per IS 1554 \(Part) Tj T*
(1\).) Tj T*
(4.4 Cable conductors shall meet the resistance requirements of IS 8130 for class 2) Tj T*
(conductors.) Tj T*
(4.5 Cables shall be laid directly in ground at a depth of 750mm with brick protection.) Tj T*
(4.6 Terminations shall be made with brass double compression glands and tinned copper) Tj T*
(lugs.) Tj T*
(4.7 CABLE DRUMS SHALL CARRY MARKING OF SIZE, TYPE, LENGTH AND MANUFACTURER'S NAME.) Tj T*
